{"title":"Billionaires including Mark Cuban are backing a high stakes legal plot to destroy Citizens United","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/billionaires-including-mark-cuban","date":1762203015000,"content":"<p>A year ago I quit my job to go full time independent. <strong>The </strong><em><strong>only</strong></em><strong> reason I’m able to do the work I do (not just this newsletter, but my bi-weekly videos, my Free Speech Friday series educating people on civil liberties, my podcast, civil rights advocacy work, and so much more)— is because of those of you who pay to support this newsletter.</strong></p><p>Since the vast majority of my paid subscribers signed up right after I went independent, these next couple months are extremely make it or break it. <strong>I hope that if you like my work, <a href=\"https://substack.com/redirect/4644953e-2a15-4c78-9ded-826b80fbf4b8?j=eyJ1Ijoib3BweiJ9.dv6befFtZNITmwd7x1IDpD-hq983jqYG51Q70Y1_eAo\">you’ll renew your paid subscription or purchase a new paid one</a> and give me the opportunity to remain independent for another year.</strong></p><p>(If you prefer not to subscribe on Substack btw, <a href=\"https://substack.com/redirect/acc6c909-cde3-44ef-852b-80ceba261d91?j=eyJ1Ijoib3BweiJ9.dv6befFtZNITmwd7x1IDpD-hq983jqYG51Q70Y1_eAo\">I’m also now on Patreon</a>!)</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GG4C!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa6a6ba2-2be4-4f27-a48d-955e139498cc_1100x21.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GG4C!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffa6a6ba2-2be4-4f27-a48d-955e139498cc_1100x21.png\" width=\"1100\" height=\"21\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GG4C!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%