1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDkd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F044953d9-eca6-46ba-ace4-17460013fb1c_600x362.webp 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>For the first time in fifteen years, there’s a real shot at ending billionaire control of American politics and dismantling Citizens United, but not by getting it overturned. </p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/billionaires-including-mark-cuban\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"2e1f7fd1efa80be7f0d004a3cffeb0c1f9038b0da4d8ba58239f1de8e7270c45","category":"Sites"}